{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1660b7587ea812758671193be55f7cd248b2915d8cc973d3daea99d5bd09b0f1", "ja": "『D/Zeal』のライブは大成功。\nジュリアと静香はライブを通して尊敬を\n深め、これからも高みを目指す決意を\n固める。ライブに参加した未来や翼、\n千早も、そんなふたりを暖かく祝福する。", "zh": "『D/Zeal』的演唱会圆满落幕。\n茱莉亚与静香经过这次演唱会，\n加深对彼此的敬意，并下定决心，\n今后要迈向更高的境界。而来观赏演唱会的\n未来、翼、千早也向两人送上温暖的祝福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7465647e3f6c1fe5bca1061222d5044abf34e9e2417fd461ee27ab0471154273", "ja": "（今日は『D/Zeal』のライブ本番……。\nジュリアと静香は期待以上のステージにしてくれた）", "zh": "（今天是『D/Zeal』的正式演唱会……\n茱莉亚和静香共同呈现出超乎期待的表演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "143d56d636f435f47795aef49cda214e96c6eef7f89a05b298b4fcfb9e375aff", "ja": "（ふたりの歌声に魅了された客席からは\nいまだに歓声が鳴りやまない……！）", "zh": "（观众沉醉在两人的歌声之中，\n欢呼声到现在都还没休止……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "77a0631ae2e84733e7551deed2c2809c225b13e65b9177f539ca5cef746ba326", "ja": "{$P$}……！\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}……！\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "8d384da330d13da5b61eccf4828c6106ed12b4d5228d723ed622f60e39e64a04", "ja": "今のあたしの全部、出し切ってきたぜ！\nどうだった、『D/Zeal』のライブは？", "zh": "我已经用尽我的全力了！\n你觉得我们『D/Zeal』的演唱会如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a54b3c4f30d52c1033389b0649c9d5b4bd33aac0f1c7b1e47ad40c8e09218d09", "ja": "まだ響いてくるこの声援が、答えだよ。\nふたりとも、本当にお疲れ様。文句なしの大成功だ！", "zh": "到现在还没停的欢呼声，就是最好的答案。\n真是辛苦你们了，演唱会毫无疑问是圆满落幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca11fb5d87b3aa694061ee8167a33617972506fd4990062ddb8799250e81588e", "ja": "そ、そうですか。確かに、手応えはありましたけど……\nちゃんとできていたなら、よかったです。", "zh": "是、是吗？我自己唱起来也感觉不错……\n如果真的有到达水准，那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "7b500830446f5e29f1c124394ae4fabf9923cf150c2b28f94f7aa17a918ba8e3", "ja": "あははっ、お互い、周りを見る余裕なんて\nなかったからな！　それくらい集中してた。", "zh": "哈哈哈！我们都没有闲功夫去注意四周！\n毕竟真的唱得很专注嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "d86cb8dd031d9e24adec31ecd41c71f525a542281db6086218b87b265a56c68c", "ja": "でも、ずっと感じてたよ。シズとふたりで作った渦が、\n客席をまきこんでいくフィーリング……。", "zh": "不过，我一直都有感受到，\n我和静卷起的漩涡，席卷了所有观众……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "7bbb0bce80361a814a80998eef17a76a4ad6ba89d80c4094c507f0aa054e97b6", "ja": "やっぱ、シズと組めてよかったぜ。\nシズとだからできたライブだった！", "zh": "能和静组团真的太棒了。\n这场演唱会就是因为和你一起才这么成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "02c7efda0717a12e5bf9813cac5ae31435d3db42e2bc31f34ed9b8ce82d24350", "ja": "……はいっ、私もです、ジュリアさん。\n今日、一緒にライブができたこと……。", "zh": "……嗯！我也这么觉得，茱莉亚。\n今天，能和你一起同台演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "c3490b4647631d9e0280975d160f94af849e7ec44bf0c5ef51ad83e5bfeb5601", "ja": "ジュリアさんと『D/Zeal』になれたことを、\n誇りに思います！", "zh": "还有这次和茱莉亚组成『D/Zeal』，\n我感到非常骄傲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "276bcb05be6af8180f3b7f2fd4d9d3a41c2518c179d3d26fa391603b83db03d0", "ja": "う～ん。それなんだよな～。", "zh": "嗯～其实我有件事想说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "8dbd4749945aa9663655840379d9f7c2d75b866f4981209227e3e33b148aa1d7", "ja": "いいか、シズ。ウチらはお互い、対等の相棒だろ？\n『さん』付けってのは、しっくりこない。", "zh": "静，你听我说，我们是对等的搭档吧。\n但你一直叫我『茱莉亚』，我总觉得哪里不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "92d4e78ad8f5fae52848a6140bf4ecc9838bdb22759bcb3c89510465e5af5df1", "ja": "『ジュリア』でいいよ。\n呼び捨てで呼んでくれ！", "zh": "像是……你可以称我『茱莉』。\n用小名称呼我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "4f74392edc47b3b82837e783a9cf84a7a15cfe2642b76bc21df384690c09c9bb", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そんな。\nいきなり言われても、心の準備が……！", "zh": "什么！？这、这怎么行？\n突然这么要求，我还没做好心理准备……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "be0597a79bf45fa6cc33249b0b1dd5eea50506a2b0df628e5b9bc3cbb0ec28d5", "ja": "ちょっと練習させてください……っ。\nジュ、ジュリ……ジュ……リ……ァ……。", "zh": "请让我练习一下……\n茱、茱莉……茱……莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "1e06dca8628b5812880da652af26d50a7c61bfef0634d5cd53d6320d80133e53", "ja": "どうした、相棒？\n聞こえないぞ～。", "zh": "怎么啦，搭档？\n我听不清楚喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "809e35e6b3798a8174a2f255f1b2bc00fa58db51c54188f9d05db0215dafa10f", "ja": "ジュ……ジュリ……ァ……さん。\nや、やっぱり無理です、呼び捨てなんてっ！", "zh": "茱……茱莉……亚。\n我、我还是没办法乱叫你的名字！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "345cc5e55bc2b6cf9230dacb9aecbc9e05b4940f85a73c1d9b70898ee4c45bce", "ja": "あはは、今さら遠慮してどうするんだよ！\nステージでの威勢はどこいったんだ？", "zh": "哈哈哈，都到现在了，还客气什么啊！\n你在舞台上的气势上哪去啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "6e542c051c2c175dcdcd0c154102982c42217ef8fe37d0e01fb777e4e2de38a0", "ja": "……いいえ。\nこれは遠慮なんかじゃありません。", "zh": "……不是的，\n这和客不客气没有关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "44811d670223cd2905a5f0ec8037d95b09baf74ce32ea99a9ee66a89700a5663", "ja": "本気でぶつかってみて、改めて思ったんです。\nやっぱりジュリアさんはすごい人だ……って。", "zh": "认真挑战过后，我重新体认到了。\n茱莉亚真的……好厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2684201eff768de2c690bbfa89bfd783d53af4fc0232be31491d60c0f4577be", "ja": "たとえ対等の相棒になっても、尊敬する気持ちは\nずっと変わりません。だから……ジュリアさん、で。", "zh": "就算我们已经是对等的搭档，我对你的尊敬依旧不变。\n所以……我还是想称呼你为茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "de3c0969616ee7d664cebba6feafb1237a87c1a186b73608870154b3b1d83d54", "ja": "……フッ、そっか。\nま、それがシズの流儀なのかもな。", "zh": "……呵，是吗？\n好吧，这大概就是静的原则吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "d028c992a7d3cb19f66a4f4f480999cfb18991cc0a9944a54b8cabcfd761cc9b", "ja": "OK、わかったよ。\nこれからも、好きに呼んでくれ！", "zh": "OK，我明白了。\n以后你想怎么叫就怎么叫吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "d58a62e47b98e34ff3c292be780ce033f7b3718d45af070179a985278fb8ae9d", "ja": "静香ちゃん、ジュリアさん！\nお疲れさま～！　す～っごくカッコよかったよ～！", "zh": "小静、茱莉亚！\n演唱会辛苦了～！你们真～的很帅喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "80a5b1da702b7ab8967bd0c11a6803d1e3b77ba983e0c2fd7cf2177487e3111b", "ja": "女の子たち、みんなキャーキャー言ってたよ。\nふたりとも、モテモテだね～。", "zh": "台下的女生全部都在大声尖叫耶。\n你们两个把大家都迷晕了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "e042997d236f5befcf0813f0c9fe942610a6510f3a76bece97fc380070cfb0ea", "ja": "モ、モテモテって……翼、あのねえ。", "zh": "什、什么迷晕……翼，我说你啊──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "f44a3df42a2146f103f783c97e878525bfac3aa9edec1ddf7ea907d4732b5f10", "ja": "……でも、ありがとう。\nふたりにも見てもらえて……、うれしかった。", "zh": "……算了，谢谢。\n你们也来看表演……我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "d1a2c30af19dca7747305172d5aca148653b305e86016f67f8813c21e857a58a", "ja": "ふたりともお疲れさま。心配はしていなかったけれど、\n……想像以上のステージだったわ、静香。", "zh": "两位辛苦了。\n虽然我并不担心……但你们的表演超乎我的想像，静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "2e04427d4c3a7fb7e115451f36c931855c9329e6002b78a122adc1a678b0d014", "ja": "ち、千早さん！\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "千、千早！\n你也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "99ed243e564a9b6c49c2bc7f42653f64e6cc3b9a6914567a2c7457d8bbf7ac17", "ja": "あんな歌い方もできるのね。\n激しくて、とても情熱的で……。", "zh": "原来你也能唱出那样的歌声，\n十分激昂、又充满热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "b183732659c565bcf81bbff29db5f99013d455d1c67c5c1d918732f02a4524a9", "ja": "でも、まだ眠っている力がありそう……。\n次の公演も、楽しみにしているわね。", "zh": "不过，感觉你还有潜力可以挖掘……\n我很期待你下次的公演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "b55b9403c7409b0d1541cc969f57a75fa709233647f1801f0fb822978ecb422d", "ja": "……！\nはいっ！", "zh": "……！\n好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "2c1e239d7c6f7abbea036168794cb68bd9f31c4a391d3e29219858611b3a78f5", "ja": "ジュリアも……さすがね。\nあなたの隣で歌う静香が、少しうらやましかった。", "zh": "茱莉亚也是……令人佩服。\n静香能在你身边歌唱，令人有点羡慕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "d464a99a78858fe33dd96d86378fc2d5fee5225559e45c9104a68713a61f4d4e", "ja": "ははっ……チハにそう言ってもらえるなんてな。\nもちろん、あたしはいつでも大歓迎だ。", "zh": "哈哈……想不到千会这么夸奖我。\n我当然随时欢迎你跟我合唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "ac63120d73c2d31f37bb0a94b9918477a6969971facfb37ffe7cb7a1557070e3", "ja": "そのときはお互い遠慮なし、\nガチで歌い合おうぜ！", "zh": "到时候可别客气，\n认真对唱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "2ed9a543d2798027f74969e3fdb9bc13a8c84fadbbd646ee41d9e41a0d9dafa8", "ja": "ええ。よろしくお願いね。", "zh": "好的，请多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "5d555b112e98951f980cbfc7dc9b92192cbc54c4a6e26c80516a5835fc692681", "ja": "（……千早の目にも、挑戦的な光が浮かんでいる。\nD/Zealから、いい刺激を受けたみたいだな）", "zh": "（……从千早的眼神中看得出她跃跃欲试。\n看来『D/Zeal』给了她很好的刺激。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4b8321eb24f222a01d5b708e761020835118999441c534604755514d85d423dd", "ja": "わあ～。なんか、オトナの関係って感じ……！\n静香ちゃん、ジュリアーノを取られちゃうかも？", "zh": "哇～她们的关系感觉好成熟喔……！\n小静，茱莉亚诺可能要被抢走啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "33cd2cc67f34292654705ed8c433c6cd6f28c4872cf8c263b32b07f1a52360c4", "ja": "な、なに言ってるのよ。取るとか取られるとか、\nそういう問題じゃないでしょ？", "zh": "你、你胡说什么啊！哪有什么抢不抢的，\n问题不在那边好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "7e9e551e6fa955419e10f94d09d725bd4a4ebb68f3d2fa8a51bd094b8f16eeb6", "ja": "そうなったら、私が静香ちゃんと歌いたいです！", "zh": "既然这样，我想和小静一起唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1f45ba11da1b10ff8242f5d45a64c565310e5531578c63f59171e7330ebb7c35", "ja": "あっ、じゃあわたしは、美希ちゃんと組みたいな～。\n{$P$}さん、お願いしま～す♪", "zh": "啊！那人家想和美希组团～\n{$P$}先生，拜托你啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e4a8e4fc4ac06eea69633d69ad8ff7e619e6a9ce7bd70cbb8498d890f05c925d", "ja": "はは、いろんなデュオができそうだな。\n考えておくよ。", "zh": "哈哈，感觉能组成很多双人组，\n我考虑看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "2791ab1517b1567fcf316523ef144ba8105d7a6db17dab1a848af5c2b81e2306", "ja": "なっ……。もう、{$P$}、\nなんでも安請け合いしないでください！", "zh": "什么……真是的，{$P$}，\n请你不要轻易答应好吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "1bd3b4b853dce0f23598418e8457c7012d4116479049bab242a32ddc1276b05a", "ja": "いい、ふたりとも。デュオを組みたいなんて軽々しく\n言うけど、そんな簡単なものじゃないのよ？", "zh": "听好了，虽然你们都没多想就说要组双人组，\n但实际上可没那么容易喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "372916f903571a0c99d92476d8882a42bd4b95dd0b457227bb08239808a2f33d", "ja": "デュオを組むには、覚悟が必要なの。\n相手の人とも自分とも、しっかりと向き合わなくちゃ。", "zh": "组成双人组是需要决心的。\n无论是对搭档或对自己，都要坦诚以对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1048_014mir", "source_sha256": "f2da0aa28b14ad3c45a51751f5918991feb9830f64c97099b21ed57f5c8e8447", "ja": "おお～。\nさすが静香ちゃん、経験者は違うな～！", "zh": "喔喔～\n不愧是小静，有经验就是不一样～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "d427da6a2891cab2aeabe8d3531417dbf559883ebf7b9bfffef520e491291b89", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\n忠告ありがとう、静香。私も気をつけるわ。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n静香，谢谢你的忠告，我会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1050_015siz", "source_sha256": "2731b1f955e42876d75094e410ef131b739d9dcb8bedefc9823283c2cd392288", "ja": "ええっ！？　ち、違うんです、今のは未来達に\n言っただけで、千早さんには、そんな……！", "zh": "咦咦！？不、不是的，我刚刚是对未来她们说的，\n并不是要对、千早、说教……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1051_050jul", "source_sha256": "858419b8c153b070fb487f038da9bf7624c20401cda8413868241528d11f8d75", "ja": "あっははは……！\nやっぱ、ここにいると退屈だけはしないな。", "zh": "哈哈哈哈……！\n待在这间剧场真的都不会无聊呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "dee6d4c7f34efcafb2d70d3b65815baaa573d1c0bb335ac0bf0e72dc92df9123", "ja": "……なあ、{$P$}。\nあたし、やっぱり思うよ。シズはすごいって。", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}。\n我还是觉得静真的很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1053_050jul", "source_sha256": "bf4c5caf881a8be334cd5bcaf7e3cb4d9d83e454a5b6f259842291d915320d54", "ja": "自分なりに、マジでアイドルやってるつもり\nだったけどさ。まだまだだって気づかされた。", "zh": "我自认已经很认真在当偶像了，\n但她让我发现自己远远不足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "5cc6e9ea0a3dd604aa675a7cdfd6513629bbb1420438e6232b8c2df1555e20e3", "ja": "あたしもこれから、もっともっと本気で\nアイドルやってくよ。だから……よろしくな！", "zh": "我以后会更认真去做好偶像的。\n所以……请多指教啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1055_p", "source_sha256": "290083cb556e4670bedc25fdf400d29c89d8b8314e7cb25d9dd665c4f55eb46c", "ja": "ああ……こちらこそ、よろしく！", "zh": "好……彼此彼此，请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1056_p", "source_sha256": "e7915c8518dcada9f9a4a980fad6b25887a47bd6f1135febc1638285f2f67c86", "ja": "（お互いを信じてぶつかり合って、\n初めてわかり合えることがたくさんある……）", "zh": "（互相信任、全力碰撞，\n有许多事情需要这样才能明白……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_07_1057_p", "source_sha256": "75088745785bada755831051687716f6a3fa56923b1060898e0d557e84376be7", "ja": "（俺も全力で信じて、そしてぶつかっていこう。\nこのアイドルたちなら……必ず、応えてくれる！）", "zh": "（我也要全力信任她们，勇于提出想法。\n这样偶像们……一定也会回应我！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
